<!-- Hard mode (greenlit "enforced-deadline" build, 2026): the group-home deadline
     (settings.xml dayLimits grouphome, default 14 days) becomes a REAL lose condition.
     In the base game it is narrative-only (feeds hint text only); here, if the player
     has not moved into an apartment before the deadline, the game ends -> GameOver_Lose
     with the "Out of Time" screen (GameOverEvent.Condition.DeadlineExpired). Read by
     ContentPack.grouphomeDeadlineEnforced and enforced in TimeManager.EndDay().
     content_flags="substance": hard mode keeps the base game's drug/alcohol content,
     so it carries the FPC substance marker (omitting it would suppress substances;
     see ContentPack.SuppressSubstances). -->
<manifest name="Hard Mode" content_flags="substance">
	<description>The group-home clock is real. Land a job and your own apartment before time runs out, or it's game over.</description>
	<tuning grouphome_deadline_enforced="true" starting_cash_min="6000" starting_cash_max="6000"/>
</manifest>
